{
 "id": "289-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Even just a short walk or a few stretches can help refresh your mind.",
  "And of course, if you ever have any questions or need any help, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "From now on, I'd like you to ensure you take a break every 70 minutes.",
  "It's important to step away, stretch your legs, and give your mind a rest.",
  "It's important to develop good habits early on.",
  "Always add comments to your code.",
  "Clear and concise comments help your colleagues and future you understand the logic and purpose of the code.",
  "Also, when naming function argument names, start them with 'j_'.",
  "This is a convention we follow here, and it helps with consistency and readability.",
  "We want your code to be readable and maintainable, and these practices will help ensure that.",
  "Taking breaks is important, and I think it's beneficial to step away from your work every 60 minutes.",
  "It helps clear your mind and stay focused when you return.",
  "Anything you want to run by me or any issues you're facing, feel free to let me know.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you need anything at all.",
  "I know some developers rely heavily on debuggers, but I find that print statements force us to really understand the code and think through the logic step-by-step.",
  "It's all about building that foundation of strong coding skills.",
  "As you gain more experience, you'll develop a keen sense of where to place those print statements and how to interpret the output efficiently."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
